sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yAwXaToV-DcQ7kNvwEMhg1a&_nc_oc=AdrkeQ1HWz6SQ1w2fXlRee1cBd7Eqymj1yaLO2do71dz3MqbH8h2bNA93nA7X5n1Ob8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGN4sOs81xfGwIE0Qruj8xJPc9xQXAt-F8XpdyM9S-wrg&oe=6A8ED11D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "294735778406481", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982510_294735781739814_4601886414751003638_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FVk-HISWg00Q7kNvwHQ637b&_nc_oc=AdpIBE-m--g83bQjXGpEgFXcCoL9J-Be0bJD-Q_8CXeeQFFrJK8yPrl9NDmbImKRdvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGQ8zeRIlKbl7gshbEiEP1wcQxC0A8OCDXRMIy02x8JQ&oe=6A8EE40E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OLC VR", "keywords": ["learning", "education", "360video", "development", "energy"], "long_description": "Real Learning in a Virtual World: Taking learning to the next level through the World Bank Group (WBG) - Open Learning Campus (OLC)  VR app. \n \nWBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challanges of global development. \n \nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generati